      "reason": "Language (English) and a dissemination/publication time restriction (within the last 10 years) are specified, but the evidence does not clearly state other report-characteristics elements such as publication/report status beyond being peer-reviewed (e.g., whether preprints/reports were included or excluded)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The provided evidence does not describe a distinction between exclusions due to outcomes not being measured versus outcomes results not being reported; no such outcome-reporting exclusion categories are shown."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The evidence does not specify how studies were grouped for syntheses or how those groups were linked to comparisons defined in the review objectives."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_20",
      "quote": "In bounding our review to studies published in the last 10 years, we excluded older studies that could have contributed to this synthesis. We also excluded studies related to topics such as nutrition and physical activity if they did not include cancer in their models or research aims. While we feel this narrowed criteria was helpful in maintaining focus... Due to our focus on cancer prevention and control, we also excluded studies that were solely related to cancer pathogenesis;",
      "reason": "Rationales are provided for notable eligibility restrictions (e.g., limiting to the last 10 years and excluding tangential topics and solely pathogenesis-focused studies)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 67
}

